{"unit_id":"ebecfb5725603b123b13","title":"提案十五、有關Tolterodine 審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b13","raw_text":"提案十五、有關Tolterodine 審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[36.0,476.7696228027344,505.5899963378906,494.4373474121094]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b14","raw_text":"說明: \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,512.7696533203125,76.4939956665039,530.4373779296875]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b15","raw_text":"1. 根據Tolterodine 之給付規定(附件5)， 符合診斷標準條件之一，並有\n","start_char":0,"end_char":43,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,548.7696533203125,557.4368286132812,566.4373779296875]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b16","raw_text":"詳實病歷紀錄，應予給付。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[78.38400268554688,584.7696533203125,274.41998291015625,602.4373779296875]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b17","raw_text":"2. 依據台灣泌尿科醫學會健保審查小組審議結果，於105.6.2 函文至健保\n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,620.7996826171875,559.4034423828125,638.4674072265625]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b18","raw_text":"署轉知本分組，確認上述用藥合乎病症及規範，當無拒絕之理由。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[78.50399780273438,656.7996826171875,546.3900146484375,674.4674072265625]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b19","raw_text":"3. 有關是否需附上尿路動力學、超音波檢查甚至膀胱鏡檢查來進一步評\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[50.15999984741211,692.7996826171875,550.0211791992188,710.4674072265625]},{"page":11,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p11-b20","raw_text":"估， 則可作為提升醫療品質之建議，尚請不要做為核刪之依據。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[64.46399688720703,728.795654296875,524.4299926757812,746.46337890625]},{"page":12,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p12-b1","raw_text":"決議：通過，同意說明段1、2、3 點。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":21,"bbox":[36.0,44.699623107910156,312.0999755859375,62.36734390258789]},{"page":12,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p12-b2","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,81.43961334228516,39.9900016784668,99.10733032226562]},{"page":12,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p12-b3","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,117.43961334228516,39.9900016784668,135.10733032226562]}],"source_quality":[]}